#ASSERT `Art 9(4) Member States may maintain or introduce further conditions, including limitations, with regard to the processing of genetic data, biometric data or data concerning health` `Art 9(1) data revealing political opinions` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 9(4) Member States may maintain or introduce further conditions, including limitations, with regard to the processing of genetic data, biometric data or data concerning health` `Art 9(1) data revealing religious or philosophical beliefs` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 9(4) Member States may maintain or introduce further conditions, including limitations, with regard to the processing of genetic data, biometric data or data concerning health` `Art 9(1) data revealing trade union membership` EQUALS NOTHING
